course: dictionary
lesson: 12297
title: Cookery
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Cookery is a word about food. It means the skill of preparing and cooking food, and it is also the name of a school subject where you learn to cook. «Our cookery lesson today is about making soup.» Here cookery means the lesson itself.
explain: You will see cookery in phrases like cookery class, cookery book and cookery programme. A cookery book is a book full of recipes. A cookery programme is a TV show where people cook. The first word tells you the topic: it is about cooking.
explain: Cookery is an uncountable noun, so we do not say "a cookery" or "two cookeries". We say «I like cookery» or «She is good at cookery». Use it for the general skill or subject, not for one meal.
fact: Cookery means the skill or activity of preparing and cooking food.
fact: Cookery can also mean a school subject or class where you learn to cook.
fact: In UK schools, cookery lessons teach food safety, measuring and recipes.
fact: In maths, cookery uses weighing, measuring and scaling recipes.
fact: Cookery is mainly used in the UK.
exercise: «Our cookery lesson today is about making soup.» In this sentence, what does cookery mean? | A type of cold drink | A game played in the playground | A shop that sells pans | *A school class where you learn to cook
exercise: «She bought a cookery book full of cake recipes.» What is a cookery book? | A book about the history of castles | A book of short poems | *A book about preparing and cooking food | A book about maths and measuring
exercise: Which phrase means a TV show where people cook? | A weather report | A spelling test | *A cookery programme
test: «Ravi loves cookery because he likes weighing flour and measuring milk.» What does cookery mean here? | *The skill of preparing and cooking food | A type of sport | A shop that sells kitchen tools | A kind of art class
test: Which sentence uses cookery correctly? | The cookery are fun to watch | *She is good at cookery | Two cookeries are on my list
exam: «The cookery programme showed how to bake bread.» What is the programme about? | *Preparing and cooking food | Building houses | Keeping animals on a farm | Growing flowers
